//? Title: Shunting yard: actual operator and value stacks
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
An infix arithmetic expression must be evaluated while respecting precedence,
parentheses and exponent associativity. An operator stack converts it to
postfix, whose value stack then computes the answer. We trace both actual
stacks, retain the original five expressions, and reject malformed syntax and
arithmetic failures explicitly.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

Keep pending operators on a stack and emit each number immediately. Before
pushing a new operator, emit stronger pending operators; equal precedence is
emitted for left-associative operators but retained for right-associative
exponentiation. A parenthesis confines emission to its matching opener. Draining
the stack completes the postfix sequence.

$$2^{3^2}=2^{(3^2)}=512,\qquad (2^3)^2=64.$$
\alttext(Exponentiation is right associative: two to the power three squared equals512, while explicitly grouped left exponentiation equals64.)

The invariant is that emitted postfix plus pending operators represents the
consumed infix prefix with its yet-unresolved bindings. Each operator is pushed
and popped once; conversion is linear in bytes. Postfix evaluation pops right
operand then left operand, computes their binary operation, and pushes one
result. A valid complete expression ends with exactly one value. Captured
whole-prefix snapshots can require quadratic storage and have a separate
copied-value policy.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/shunting_yard_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto r = a::shunting_yard_trace("3+4*2");
    std::print("| actual token | pending operators | actual output |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.conversion)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} |\n", s.token,
                   s.operators.empty() ? "(empty)" : s.operators,
                   s.output.empty() ? "(empty)" : s.output);
    std::print("\n| RPN token | actual value stack |\n| --- | --- |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.evaluation)
        std::print("| {} | `{}` |\n", s.token, s.stack);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Infix 3 + 4 * 2");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0}, std::format("Postfix {}", r.postfix));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0}, std::format("Value {}", r.value));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/shunting_yard_tiny.svg");
}
```
// result_begin: markdown
| actual token | pending operators | actual output |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 3 | (empty) | 3 |
| + | + | 3 |
| 4 | + | 3 4 |
| * | +* | 3 4 |
| 2 | +* | 3 4 2 |
| flush | (empty) | 3 4 2 * + |

| RPN token | actual value stack |
| --- | --- |
| 3 | `[3]` |
| 4 | `[3, 4]` |
| 2 | `[3, 4, 2]` |
| * | `[3, 8]` |
| + | `[11]` |
